COMPONENT STATE
================================================================================

Only these values need state:

groceryItems

filter


Why?


groceryItems:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Changes when:

• Item is toggled

• Item is deleted


filter:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Changes when:

• User clicks All

• User clicks To Buy

• User clicks Purchased


================================================================================
DERIVED VALUES
================================================================================

These do NOT need separate state:

filteredItems

totalItems

purchasedCount

remainingCount

totalCost

purchasedCost

averageLineCost


They can be calculated directly from:

groceryItems
+
filter


MEMORY:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

STORE:

THE MINIMUM STATE NEEDED


DERIVE:

WHAT CAN BE CALCULATED FROM STATE


================================================================================
KEY CODE EXPLANATION
================================================================================

+---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| CODE                      | PURPOSE                                    |
+---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+
| useState(FAKE_GROCERIES)  | Initialize sample items                   |
| useState('ALL')           | Store selected filter                     |
| filter()                  | Derive visible/purchased items            |
| map()                     | Render/update items                       |
| reduce()                  | Calculate costs                           |
| key={item.id}             | Stable identity in list rendering        |
| checked={item.purchased}  | Controlled checkbox                      |
| filter-btn active         | Selected filter styling                   |
+---------------------------+--------------------------------------------+


